### My answer to the prompt

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Explore Zeroh</title>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html, body {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      margin: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
      background: #000;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    .hero {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      isolation: isolate;
      color: #fff;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .hero video {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: -1;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 8vw, 5rem);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    button {
      padding: 0.9rem 1.8rem;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      background: transparent;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      font-size: 1rem;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: background-color 250ms ease, color 250ms ease,
                  border-color 250ms ease;
    }

    button:hover,
    button:focus-visible {
      border-color: #fff;
      background: #fff;
      color: #000;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="hero">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-hidden="true">
      <source src="video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div>
      <h1>Explore Zeroh</h1>
      <button type="button">Join Waitlist</button>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
```

Replace `video.mp4` with the path to your video.

